<title>JAPAN: BOXING-AMERICAN JOHNSTON RETAINS WBC LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-AMERICAN JOHNSTON RETAINS WBC LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Steve Johnston retained his World Boxing Council (WBC) lightweight title with a split points decision over Japan's Hiroyuki Sakamoto on Saturday.</p>
</text>
